    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 114,
        "text": "I have finished the article about the library club, but I want to verify a few details before we publish it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "673d6732481455b15f0700c0e032778034268a5f118d73e5509e3afcc9a8e868",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 120,
        "sourceEnd": 215,
        "text": "Good. The headline says fifty people attended the meeting. Does the source support that number?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f8a1f369d1ae14d082536b320ec309cfc7c0e6b72b7ad99eeb42e4ee8943cfe4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 222,
        "sourceEnd": 388,
        "text": "No. The attendance record says twenty. I will compare it with the organizer's notes before changing the text. The first paragraph currently repeats the larger number.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "36b949bdc1a9709dde88f49cdf3cd4270cc9c60c8c5dde1031255dfbf5cbb5d2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 394,
        "sourceEnd": 547,
        "text": "The picture caption also needs a change. It says the group met on Tuesday, but the record shows Thursday. Can you use the link to open the original note?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "929010d67f18330d1a107e676f3f7cbf480929f1de4e2bed83fe66d6b56ac330",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 554,
        "sourceEnd": 707,
        "text": "Yes. The passage about the event mentions Thursday as well. I can zoom in on the image and enlarge the note, although that alone does not prove the date.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "59c2469511c2dceab1785ae6ff40885544d9c8c95b4917064610a416afd4abba",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 713,
        "sourceEnd": 852,
        "text": "There is an advertisement below the picture. The publisher should label it clearly, so readers do not mistake it for a fact in the article.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0c2c05d5960b22a51f93682dee7b4f9b19e8d3e84079e1f4ed82f953204b77b4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 859,
        "sourceEnd": 1013,
        "text": "Agreed. The publication includes a quote from the club leader, and the citation points to our interview. I will check that we have copied her exact words.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "77d8536e1bee57c6a6edc92b93372793bbb14f9431c7e3e4472ba2716731893f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1019,
        "sourceEnd": 1219,
        "text": "Before you forward the photograph, remember privacy. Our club rule says we must have permission from everyone who can be recognized. We do not have to print any names if people prefer not to be named.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "03f950e3a8d5343acaa7b69dbbd8c964b48ba3fdab312858b421ba092434a8d3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1226,
        "sourceEnd": 1375,
        "text": "I will ask first. We might use a picture of the empty room if one person does not want to appear. May I add a comment asking readers for suggestions?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6af1b96f7a4b6f68d672fb47b67d0424681cfa35ab24b0a2f7c30bc8583c2058",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1381,
        "sourceEnd": 1565,
        "text": "Yes. Put it near the small icon that opens comments, and offer a way to subscribe to the newsletter. People should be able to find the contact details without opening an advertisement.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "1a8243faac5cfd2d0d1ba9858141d7839d4f1be19d18270d1e8388e8224762d7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1572,
        "sourceEnd": 1696,
        "text": "One last point: the article says everyone loved the event. That claim may show bias because only six people gave an opinion.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "532c1beb219b04b4307d4d3946c313f77ca8b308387736190ff65ba59f5b1638",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1702,
        "sourceEnd": 1861,
        "text": "Then let's describe that limit. The result will be more useful if readers can see the evidence. We can print copies after the group approves the final version.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "83817c47a282a350fd68144c12ac684755ab6d676e2477b079c2e6ab405952fa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1868,
        "sourceEnd": 1913,
        "text": "I will send the revised draft this afternoon.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c6ee826efaedbb2a1529b88606a0c3a6a280fb727680b1596885c92df21585be",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
